    如 | rú | as if; like | Has 口 on right instead of 子
    容 | róng | contain; tolerate | Has 谷 below 宀 instead of 各
    家 | jiā | family | Has pig 豕 below 宀 instead of 各
    安 | ān | peaceful | Has 女 below 宀 instead of 各
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
